<section class="table-card"><div class="table-top"><h2>Ringkasan Keputusan</h2><p>Rekomendasi sederhana berdasarkan data harga jual, HPP, dan biaya tetap.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Indikator</th><th>Hasil</th><th>Interpretasi</th></tr></thead><tbody id="decisionRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
